70
00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:15.100
It was such a treat having Ryan Howard in the office.

71
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:19.120
I am not a huge baseball fan, but I definitely knew who he was.

72
00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.360
