73
00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.200
And he just, it was fun.

74
00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.140
It was fun to have him around.

75
00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.500
I thought he did such a good job.

76
00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:30.280
John and Craig were really excited to have him on set.

77
00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.260
And they made him feel really welcome.

78
00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.500
And it seemed like he was having a fun time.

79
00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.540
Well, let me tell you something.

