00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.340
I did something Krasla.

81
00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.440
I know you're done.

82
00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.380
I slid into Ryan Howard's DMs on Instagram.

83
00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.620
You told me you were going to, and I was like, okay.

84
00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.600
Well, every time we do that with someone that we don't know as well, I'm always like, whoa.

85
00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.360
I know, well, we didn't have any scenes with him.

86
00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.100
We didn't.

87
00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:56.500
So I was like, well, it's worth a shot.

88
00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.660
By the way, he is from my hometown of St. Louis, Missouri.

89
00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:06.740
So I tried to pull out some good Emo's Pizza toasted ravioli references in my DM to butter them up.

90
00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.860
And guess what?

91
00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.660
He is, just as you suspected, the nicest guy.

92
00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.560
