93
00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.380
About his time on The Office, on the set.

94
00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:18.340
He's wonderful.

95
00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:19.000
Wonderful.

96
00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.840
So the first thing we asked was, what was it like shooting The Office from his perspective?

97
00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.040
And here's what he had to say.

98
00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.660
Jenna, Angela, thank you guys so, so much.

99
00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.460
