101
00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:38.840
So question one was, how was my experience shooting The Office?

102
00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.280
Absolutely amazing.

103
00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:46.380
The cast, everyone, John and Craig were outstanding.

104
00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:49.760
Everybody made it so fluid and so easy for me.

105
00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:54.000
They just told me to just be myself, just relax and have fun.

106
00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.300
And just made it very, very loose and easy for me to be able to enjoy myself doing it.

107
00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.800
So really, really made it seamless.

108
00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.760
And I really had fun doing it.

109
00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.080
Loved every moment of it.

110
00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:04.780
All right.

111
00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:09.940
So then I had to ask him, was he a fan of the show when he got the job?

112
00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.840
