118
00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.940
And I was like, oh man, that seems really cool.

119
00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:37.300
And then, you know, kind of fast forward, you know, through my career and the opportunity

120
00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.540
to be able to get on the show, ultimately became a fan.

121
00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:44.640
And the more I started to learn more about the show and be able to watch the show.

122
00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:49.160
And so having the opportunity to hop on there was something that was really, really cool

123
00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:49.780
and unique.

124
00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:56.440
The way that I came about it was, you know, my agent at the time, I guess, you know, had

125
00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.760
some connections over there.

126
00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:03.940
And obviously with the character of Ryan Howard on the show and myself, I think it only made

127
00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:04.280
sense.

128
00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.100
It really only made sense to do it.

129
00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:11.320
And like I said, for me, it was something that's, you know, outside of my usual comfort

130
00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:14.260
zone and wanted to kind of challenge myself.

131
00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:20.400
