01:00:05.400 --> 01:00:10.420
about Pam revisiting Brian the Boom Guy in this episode while her and Jim's relationship was

1256
01:00:10.420 --> 01:00:12.360
still in such a tense stage?

1257
01:00:12.820 --> 01:00:16.180
Do you think Pam told Jim she went to Brian's house that day?

