01:00:19.900 --> 01:00:22.880
I don't think she told Jim she went to his house.

1260
01:00:23.220 --> 01:00:24.020
I don't either.

1261
01:00:24.020 --> 01:00:29.060
Not because she felt like she did something wrong, but I feel like Jim isn't the person

1262
01:00:29.060 --> 01:00:30.400
she talks to right now.

1263
01:00:31.120 --> 01:00:31.360
Yeah.

1264
01:00:31.640 --> 01:00:36.820
I think I'm just remembering when they were at lunch and Jim found out that Pam and Brian

