01:00:36.820 --> 01:00:41.200
had been talking more than he understood and it caused tension.

1266
01:00:41.200 --> 01:00:44.260
And I think Pam is avoiding all tension right now.

1267
01:00:44.600 --> 01:00:46.580
So she just doesn't want to bring it up.

1268
01:00:46.580 --> 01:00:48.000
It's like the last thing they need.

1269
01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:48.500
Yeah.

1270
01:00:48.800 --> 01:00:50.980
Well, I think that's Pam's perspective.

1271
01:00:51.420 --> 01:00:59.080
As Jenna, I will say that this Pam-Brian story went through many, many iterations, as they

1272
01:00:59.080 --> 01:01:01.000
always did, as they had been.

1273
01:01:01.720 --> 01:01:09.780
In the table draft for this, the script we read at the table read, Brian hit on Pam when

