01:01:09.780 --> 01:01:10.780
she went to the apartment.

1275
01:01:11.280 --> 01:01:12.160
Oh, no.

1276
01:01:12.600 --> 01:01:13.100
Mm-hmm.

1277
01:01:13.300 --> 01:01:14.520
How did he hit on her?

1278
01:01:14.740 --> 01:01:18.140
Well, they start by discussing the promos.

1279
01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:22.400
So she gets all her promo questions out of the way firSt.

1280
01:01:22.980 --> 01:01:26.420
