01:02:27.040 --> 01:02:31.420
Yeah, I remembered it so clearly because, you know, after the table reads,

1303
01:02:31.420 --> 01:02:38.060
John and I would stay after, and we would give our notes, and we were like, you know,

1304
01:02:38.200 --> 01:02:41.780
record scratch on the old Brian hits on Pam.

1305
01:02:42.120 --> 01:02:44.500
Yeah, Brian's not touching her face or her hair.

1306
01:02:44.720 --> 01:02:45.840
Mm-mm, mm-mm.

1307
01:02:46.460 --> 01:02:49.280
What they ended up doing is they kind of flipped it.

1308
01:02:49.440 --> 01:02:55.800
So now she has this weird kind of confession to Brian that she gets out,

1309
01:02:55.920 --> 01:02:58.820
but he doesn't take the ball and run with it.

1310
01:02:58.920 --> 01:03:00.800
He doesn't hit on her as a result.

1311
01:03:01.420 --> 01:03:04.920
And then she switches gears and talks about the promos,

1312
01:03:04.920 --> 01:03:09.280
and then she storms out because she feels like he didn't protect her as a friend,

1313
01:03:09.280 --> 01:03:10.760
